   "fadeOut": 0.35,
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "EPIC'S SDK, SHIPPED TWICE.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 56
  },
  {
   "text": "This cooking demo ships\nEpic's SDK twice. Once for\nyour PC, and once for\nARM64.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 6.681,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It's a Windows only build.\nThat second copy never\nruns.",
   "start": 6.931,
   "duration": 4.434,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It's Tasty Chef, a co-op\nrestaurant sim that went\nup two days ago.",
   "start": 14.615,
   "duration": 4.539,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "The build is 1.16\ngigabytes, and 1.01 of\nthat is one Unity bundle.",
   "start": 19.404,
   "duration": 6.158,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Around it, thirty six\nmegabytes of Epic Online\nServices, plus an ARM64\nloader and renderer.",
   "start": 25.812,
   "duration": 6.863,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "And one file called eos\ndash Editor dot steam dot\nutility. Editor. In the\ncopy you download.",
   "start": 32.925,
   "duration": 6.994,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
